#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials instead of manually entering them"
msgstr "I-save ang iyong mga login credential sa halip na manu-manong i-type ang mga ito"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials"
msgstr "I-save ang iyong mga login credential"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials {#save-your-login-credentials}"
msgstr "I-save ang iyong mga login credential {#save-your-login-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation), you can use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally, then use them to initialize the service.\n"
msgstr "Kung gumagamit ka ng trusted na Python environment (tulad ng personal na laptop o workstation), maaari mong gamitin ang `save_account()` method para i-save ang iyong mga credential nang lokal, tapos gamitin ang mga ito para i-initialize ang serbisyo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga Tala\">\n"
"      * Kung gumagamit ka ng pampublikong computer o ibang hindi trusted na environment, sundin ang mga instruksyon sa [I-initialize ang serbisyo sa isang hindi trusted na environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) sa halip.\n"
"      * Sundin ang [mga instruksyong ito](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) kung gusto mong kumonekta gamit ang REST API sa halip na Qiskit.\n"
"      * Kung kinakailangan, gamitin ang [impormasyong ito](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) para i-configure ang iyong firewall para ma-access ang mga IBM Quantum API endpoint.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [`qiskit` and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` packages installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking nasa aktibong Python environment ka na may [`qiskit` at `qiskit-ibm-runtime` packages na naka-install](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang Python virtual environment at patakbuhin ang Python sa iyong virtual environment.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Mag-login sa [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Hanapin ang iyong mga access credential {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking napili ang tamang account at rehiyon sa account switcher sa header.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key. From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. Note that you can use the same API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang iyong API key. Mula sa [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), gumawa ng iyong API key, tapos kopyahin ito sa isang ligtas na lugar para magamit mo ito para sa authentication. Tandaan na maaari mong gamitin ang parehong API key para kumonekta sa anumang rehiyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Opsyonal: Hanapin ang instance na gusto mong gamitin mula sa pahina ng [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). I-hover ang cursor sa CRN nito, i-click ang icon para kopyahin ito, tapos i-save sa ligtas na lugar para magamit mo ito para matukoy ang instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your access credentials {#save-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "I-save ang iyong mga access credential {#save-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your credentials by running the appropriate code once per account you want to save. After saving your credentials, load them by following the steps in [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account).\n"
msgstr "I-save ang iyong mga credential sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng angkop na code nang isang beses bawat account na gusto mong i-save. Pagkatapos i-save ang iyong mga credential, i-load ang mga ito sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa mga hakbang sa [I-initialize ang IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials that access a specific instance: {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"
msgstr "I-save ang mga credential na nag-a-access sa isang partikular na instance: {#save-credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have multiple instances and want to easily tell Quantum Compute which instance to use, save credentials that include an instance CRN.\n"
msgstr "Kung mayroon kang maraming instance at gusto mong madaling sabihin sa Quantum Compute kung aling instance ang gagamitin, mag-save ng mga credential na naglalaman ng instance CRN.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save credentials for automatic instance selection: {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"
msgstr "I-save ang mga credential para sa awtomatikong pagpili ng instance: {#save-credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't provide an instance CRN and pass these credentials to Quantum Compute, an appropriate instance will be chosen for you, based on the specified options.\n"
msgstr "Kung hindi ka magbibigay ng instance CRN at ipapasa ang mga credential na ito sa Quantum Compute, pipiliin para sa iyo ang angkop na instance batay sa mga tinukoy na opsyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2 {#example-2}"
msgstr "Halimbawa 2 {#example-2}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example saves credentials for automatic instance selection.  Quantum Compute will only look at premium instances in the EU region that are available to the account. These credentials become the new default.\n"
msgstr "Ang halimbawang ito ay nagse-save ng mga credential para sa awtomatikong pagpili ng instance. Titingnan lang ng Quantum Compute ang mga premium instance sa rehiyong EU na available sa account. Ang mga credential na ito ang magiging bagong default.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View saved credentials {#view-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang mga na-save na credential {#view-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To view all credentials that you have saved, run `service.saved_accounts()`.  Note that if you saved default credentials and didn't name them, they are named `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. If you did name your default credentials, you will see `\"is_default_account\": true` in the output.\n"
msgstr "Para makita ang lahat ng credential na na-save mo, patakbuhin ang `service.saved_accounts()`. Tandaan na kung nag-save ka ng default na mga credential at hindi mo pinangalanan ang mga ito, ang pangalan nila ay `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. Kung pinangalanan mo ang iyong default na mga credential, makikita mo ang `\"is_default_account\": true` sa output.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations {#considerations}"
msgstr "Mga Konsiderasyon {#considerations}"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are saving multiple accounts, use the `name` parameter to differentiate them.\n"
msgstr "Kung nagse-save ka ng maraming account, gamitin ang parameter na `name` para makilala ang mga ito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credentials are saved to `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`.  Do not manually edit this file.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga credential ay nase-save sa `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`. Huwag manu-manong i-edit ang file na ito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't save your credentials, you must specify them every time you start a new session (instantiate IBM Quantum Compute Service).\n"
msgstr "Kung hindi mo ise-save ang iyong mga credential, kailangan mong tukuyin ang mga ito sa bawat beses na magsisimula ka ng bagong session (pag-instantiate ng IBM Quantum Compute Service).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you manually specify your credentials, a saved account will not be used.\n"
msgstr "Kung manu-mano mong tinukoy ang iyong mga credential, hindi gagamitin ang na-save na account.\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga Susunod na Hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account) in a trusted Python environment.\n"
"  -  [Initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"  -  [View your available QPUs](/guides/qpu-information#available).\n"
"  -  [Configure the Qiskit SDK locally](/guides/configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  -  [I-initialize ang IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/initialize-account) sa isang trusted na Python environment.\n"
"  -  [I-initialize ang IBM Quantum Compute Service sa isang **hindi trusted na environment**.](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted)\n"
"  -  [Tingnan ang iyong mga available na QPU.](/guides/qpu-information#available)\n"
"  -  [I-configure ang Qiskit SDK nang lokal.](/guides/configure-qiskit-local)\n"
"  -  Sundin ang mga hakbang sa gabay na [Patakbuhin ang iyong unang circuit sa hardware](/guides/hello-world) para magsulat at magpatakbo ng quantum program.\n"
"  -  [I-set up para gamitin ang IBM Quantum Platform gamit ang REST API.](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api)\n"
"  -  Subukan ang isang [tutorial.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
